@startuml UML时序图
title Booking and Hotel Confirmation Sequence Diagram (REQ-005~011)

skinparam dpi 150
skinparam defaultFontName "Helvetica Neue"

actor Customer
participant "SearchService" as Search
participant "BookingService" as Booking
participant "FulfillmentService" as Fulfill
participant "PricingPolicy" as Pricing
participant "InventoryPolicy" as Inventory
participant "Persistence" as DB
actor "HotelStaff" as Staff

Customer -> Search : search(city, dates, guests)
Search -> Inventory : checkNightlyAvailability(roomType, range, rooms)
Inventory -> DB : load daily inventory
DB --> Inventory : inventory records
Search -> Pricing : quote(roomType, range, rooms)
Pricing -> DB : load daily prices
DB --> Pricing : price records
Pricing --> Search : nightly prices + total
Search --> Customer : available list (with totals)

Customer -> Booking : submitOrder(contact, requestId)
note right of Booking : same requestId returns the existing order\nidempotent, no duplicate orders (REQ-009)
Booking -> Pricing : recompute quote
Pricing --> Booking : current quote
Booking -> Inventory : occupyAllNights(order)
Inventory -> DB : transaction: create order + nightly occupancy
note right of DB : atomic: if the price changed or any night\nis short, roll back and reject (REQ-008/023)\ncustomer is asked to re-query
DB --> Inventory : committed
Inventory --> Booking : occupied
Booking -> DB : write operation log
Booking --> Customer : orderNo + PENDING

== Hotel confirmation (within 30 min, REQ-010) ==

Staff -> Fulfill : confirm(orderNo)
Fulfill -> DB : validate state and set CONFIRMED
note right of Fulfill : only PENDING -> CONFIRMED is allowed\nno duplicate stock deduction (REQ-010/025)
DB --> Fulfill : updated
Fulfill --> Staff : CONFIRMED

@enduml
